- [Minecraft.js](src/js/net/minecraft/client/Minecraft.js) routes wheel input to width and `R` to variant changes.
- [WorldRenderer.js](src/js/net/minecraft/client/render/WorldRenderer.js) updates and draws the preview each frame.
- Multiplayer builds are sent as per-cell pavement placement packets so the server persists and broadcasts them.

